{"id":"00008","root":"uni00008_1","name":{"ja":"ナーサラ","en":"Nasara"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ナーサラ","en":"Nasara"},"aliases":["Narsala"],"element":"Spiritual","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":8,"profile":{"ja":"魔界に突如現れた知的生命体。何かのはずみで生み出され、それ以来魔界を当てもなく徘徊する。本能にしたがい、他の物質や生物を取りこんでいく。一度取り込んだ種類の者や物は取り込まない。本能的に新たな物や知識を取り込むようになっており、女の形を形成しているのも、知識を取りこむために有用だからである。人の姿をしているが、さまざまな形に変化出来る。生物的な感情はほとんどなく、ただ無造作に作業をする。ただし敵意を向けられると、その限りではなく、破壊を繰り返す。そのため、敵か捕食対象でない限りは敵対はしない。","en":"Nasara is an intelligent lifeform that suddenly emerged in the Demon Realm. Created by some unknown catalyst, she has roamed the Demon Realm aimlessly ever since. Acting on instinct, she assimilates other substances and organisms, but never repeats a type she has already absorbed. Her instinct drives her to constantly acquire new matter and knowledge, which is why she has taken on a female form—it proves useful for gathering information. Though she appears human, she can shift into many shapes. She possesses little biological emotion and merely performs tasks indiscriminately, yet she will retaliate violently if she is attacked, repeatedly destroying her foe. Consequently, she does not act hostile unless someone is an enemy or prey."},"illustrator":"SASAYUKi","voiceActor":"三十三七","forms":[{"id":"uni00008_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1224,2448],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[165,332],"def":[133,266],"spd":[49,49],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","27"]},{"id":"uni00008_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1848,3696],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[255,509],"def":[191,383],"spd":[49,49],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","27","28"]},{"id":"uni00008_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2472,4944],"sp":[330,330],"atk":[345,690],"def":[249,499],"spd":[49,49],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","27","28","29"]}],"skills":{"3":{"slot":"attack",